==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|enthron|ing}}

# {{transitive}} to put on the throne in a formal installation ceremony called ''[[enthronement]]'', equivalent to (and often combined with) [[coronation]] and/or other ceremonies of [[investiture]]
# {{transitive}} in a figurative sense, to help a candidate to the succession of a monarchy (as a kingmaker does), or by extention in any other major organisation

